<title>UK: BLENHEIM SAYS FURTHER APPROACH MADE.</title>
<headline>BLENHEIM SAYS FURTHER APPROACH MADE.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Blenheim Group Plc said in a statement it had received a further approach &quot;at a level that the board has previously rejected.&quot;</p>
<p>It said the approach may or may not lead to an offer for the company and a further announcement would be made when appropriate.</p>
</text>
